This repository shares domain concepts (workout/exercise/set, revision-based
synchronization) with, and is a companion to:

- LIFT Android (dugcanlift-lift) — Apache-2.0
- LIFT iOS (dugcanlift-lift-ios) — Apache-2.0

No source from those repositories is vendored here; `apple/LiftKit` is a
clean-room reimplementation of the shared contract described in
`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `shared/contracts/workout-sync.schema.json`.
